---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use | RentLocalMachinery" description="Terms for using RentLocalMachinery's equipment rental quote service.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4 px-4 py-10 text-slate-700">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: November 2026. This is a general template; have a lawyer review it before relying on it.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">What we are</h2>
    <p>RentLocalMachinery is a quote-request service. We are not an equipment rental company and we do not own or rent equipment. We pass your request to independent suppliers who may contact you with availability and pricing.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Prices</h2>
    <p>Prices shown on this site are estimates based on typical U.S. rental rates. They are not offers. The final price, availability, delivery charges, deposits and rental terms are set by each supplier.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">No guarantee</h2>
    <p>We do not guarantee that a supplier will respond, that equipment will be available, or that you will receive a particular price. Any rental agreement is between you and the supplier.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Your responsibilities</h2>
    <p>Please provide accurate contact details. Safe operation, licensing, insurance and site requirements are your responsibility and the supplier's; follow all applicable laws and manufacturer guidance.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
